#, qt-format
msgctxt "QObject|"
msgid ""
"The log has %1 lines, exceeding mclo.gs' limit of %2.\n"
"The launcher can keep the first %3 and last %4 lines, trimming the middle.\n"
"\n"
"If you choose 'No', mclo.gs will only keep the first %2 lines, cutting off "
"potentially useful info like crashes at the end.\n"
"\n"
"Proceed with truncation?"
msgstr ""
"该日志有 %1 行，超过了 mclo.gs 的 %2 行限制。\n"
"启动器可以保留开头 %3 行和结尾 %4 行，去除中间部分。\n"
"\n"
"如果你选择“否”，mclo.gs 将只会保留开头 %2 行，这可能会去除潜在有用信息，比如结尾的崩溃。\n"
"\n"
"要继续截断吗？"

